{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02764","headline":"赠李荣道士 · 卢照邻","name":"赠李荣道士","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"锦节衔天使，琼仙驾羽君。\n投金翠山曲，奠璧清江濆。\n圆洞开丹鼎，方坛聚绦云。\n宝贶幽难识，空歌迥易分。\n风摇十洲影，日乱九江文。\n敷诚归上帝，应诏在明君。\n独有南冠客，耿耿泣离羣。\n遥看八会所，真气晓氤氲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢照邻","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02764.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02764","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}